  "bodyHash": "b2b90f376033726b",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishcute/Celestial/main/modpage/logo.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"628\" height=\"163\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishcute/Celestial/main/modpage/line.png\"></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://github.com/fishcute/Celestial/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sbxmXSa.png\" alt=\"github\" width=\"223\" height=\"75\"></a></em></p>\n<p>Celestial 是一款模组，允许你以多种方式自定义天空，例如添加新行星、更改星星以及许多其他功能！所有内容均通过资源包进行配置，因此无需手动修改配置文件。Celestial 还支持多种游戏版本，且资源包在不同版本中的功能完全一致。</p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/fishcute/Celestial/blob/main/modpage/features_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"features\" width=\"600\" height=\"72\"><br></strong></h2>\n<p>- 在天空中创建新的行星与恒星。</p>\n<p>- 自定义天空与雾的颜色。</p>\n<p>- 自定义雾的渲染距离。</p>\n<p>- 可更改云朵的颜色与高度。</p>\n<p>- 使用自定义纹理或纯色创建天空盒。</p>\n<p>- 能够创建沉浸式且动态的天空效果，并提供海量可调参数。</p>\n<p>- 支持自定义原版或模组添加的任何维度的天空。</p>\n<p>- 以及更多功能！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishcute/Celestial/main/modpage/note.png\" alt=\"未加载任何资源包时，本模组不会生效\" width=\"1036\" height=\"57\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishcute/Celestial/main/modpage/line.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/fishcute/Celestial/blob/main/modpage/demo_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"demo\" width=\"600\" height=\"72\"></p>\n<p>以下是 Celestial 的一些效果示例：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/661111/description_be97793d-707e-4689-bbfc-a7ec3663dd97.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>外星行星的天空。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZZIWRqQ.png\" width=\"775\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/661111/description_5c1aec64-4f78-41dd-a290-7fdd159cfd3f.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>主世界，在 y = 11,000 处渲染。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/urFmIz4.png\" width=\"775\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/661111/description_b8aa9211-e7c9-440b-a3cb-376764ce1c8d.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>飓风。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GSkrvvD.png\" width=\"775\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/661111/description_0df2cd3a-37b8-47e4-b3ff-4e26e6e870a0.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>带有太阳系行星的夜空。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/w4j40K9.png\" width=\"775\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/661111/description_de9bdd82-d5ee-421f-b46a-4af3eefa267b.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>卫星（演示中不可用）。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/t2Gx3bP.png\" width=\"775\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/661111/description_63a06273-fcdb-401f-8cc0-1dfbbab11671.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>想体验这些演示效果吗？请在此处<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/celestial-demo-packs\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/fishcute/Celestial/blob/main/modpage/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>来看看由 UsernameGeri 制作的、支持 Celestial 的资源包吧！</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fhyper-realistic-sky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Hyper Realistic Sky</strong> - 为天空添加极其逼真的天空盒。</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fPsMUgCo5%252f9dfcd16ad30862485e9ca2b9857327bc7fbb1999_96.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/PsMUgCo5/9dfcd16ad30862485e9ca2b9857327bc7fbb1999_96.webp\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsnowy-mountains-sky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Snowy Mountains Sky</strong> - 为你的我的世界世界增添逼真的山脉景观。</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/B9RvpVrv/471d554c89ca16d6248aac4a618beba433b921b5_96.webp\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252felden-ring-sky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Elden Ring Sky</strong> - 添加来自《艾尔登法环》的多个天空盒。</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/661111/description_9c74a6de-1976-442e-9a80-45b7c7ab2984.webp\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/fishcute/Celestial/blob/main/modpage/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>Fabric 版本需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></strong></p>\n<p>如果你想制作自己的资源包，请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/fishcute/Celestial/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>的 Wiki。</p>\n<p><strong>欢迎在整合包或个人内容中使用本模组！</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/fishcute/Celestial/blob/main/modpage/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>需要帮助或遇到问题？欢迎加入 Discord 服务器！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9KsHkDE6u2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eQQ9rTs.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"100\"></a></p>",
